<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it raised its rating on Xilinx Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $1.43 per share from $1.33 and 1998 estimate to $1.79 from $1.54.</p>
<p>-- Set nine-to-12 month price target of $42 based on 25 times calendar 1997 earnings estimate of $1.68 per share.</p>
<p>-- Cited strengthening business trends, solid long-term fundamentals and manufacturing cost improvements due to weak Japanese yen.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 37-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
